{
  // The unit suite's own typecheck (issue #1135, closing UT-G1 for this
  // package). `tsconfig.json` is the BUILD config — `rootDir: "src"`,
  // `composite`, emits to `dist` — so it can never include `tests/**`; a
  // composite project cannot see files outside its `rootDir`. Wired into the
  // root `typecheck` script, which is the half that matters: a config that
  // merely exists is checked by nothing.
  //
  // `lib: ["ES2022", "DOM"]` for `structuredClone` and `crypto`, which several
  // tests legitimately use. CLAUDE.md hard rule 1 (domain is pure) is NOT
  // weakened by this: purity is enforced over IMPORTS by
  // `eslint-plugin-boundaries` and dependency-cruiser, and the widening here
  // reaches only the test program. `packages/domain/tsconfig.json` keeps
  // `lib: ["ES2022"]` and gains nothing, so `src` still cannot see a DOM global.
  //
  // `.test-d.ts` files are ALSO covered here — `include: ["tests/**/*"]` matches
  // `canonItem.types.test-d.ts`, `mealPlanTemplate.types.test-d.ts` and
  // `shoppingListItem.types.test-d.ts` too, same as everything else under
  // `tests/`. `tsconfig.typetest.json` + the `typecheck` block in
  // `vitest.config.ts` (UT-G4, issue #932) is the config that OWNS them and
  // runs them under `vitest run`, but this config compiles the same three
  // files a second time under different options (this one inherits the
  // package's `lib`; that one sets `types: []` and its own `lib`), so the two
  // programs can disagree about the same file. Narrowing this `include` to
  // drop them was considered and rejected: TypeScript overrides — does not
  // merge — `exclude` across `extends`, so a hand-written `exclude` here would
  // silently drop the `**/__boundary_tests__/**` this config inherits from
  // `tsconfig.base.json`, and `packages/domain/src/**/__boundary_tests__/`
  // (which this config's `include` also reaches via `src/**/*`) is real. A
  // disclosed double-compile beats that risk.
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "rootDir": ".",
    "composite": false,
    "noEmit": true,
    "declaration": false,
    "declarationMap": false,
    "lib": ["ES2022", "DOM"]
  },
  "include": ["src/**/*", "tests/**/*"]
}
